            <div xml:id="d572">

                <pb facs="0560" n="548" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg548"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.51A/885d: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Dreyfus</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-10-23T22:00:00-04:00">October 23,
                            1943—10 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>547. We have stressed to the Iranian Legation here the points made in the final
                    paragraph of your 1007, October 19, 8 p.m. and we believe you should take
                    similar action with the Prime Minister as under instructions from the
                    Department.</p>
                <p>Sent to Tehran. Repeat to Moscow marked “For Jernegan”.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
